  "name": "Beef Tagine with Oranges",
  "text": "Beef Tagine with Oranges\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n1-2 tbsp ghee or 1 tbsp olive oil + 1 tbsp butter,\n\n3-4 garlic cloves (crushed),\n\n1 red onion (halved and sliced),\n\n5cm/2” fresh ginger (peeled and finely chopped or grated),\n\n1 fresh red chilli (deseeded and sliced),\n\n2 tsp coriander seeds,\n\n2 cinamon sticks,\n\n2-4 beetroot (peeled and quartered),\n\n500g beef (cubed or cut in strips),\n\n2 thin skinned oranges (cut into segments),\n\n1 tbsp dark clear honey,\n\n1-2 tbsp orange flower water,\n\n1 tbsp butter,\n\n2-3 tbsp shelled pistachios,\n\nleaves from a small bunch of fresh flat leaf parsley (roughly chopped).\n\nPreparation\n\n1.",
  "recipeYield": "4",
